WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.818 --> 00:00:02.929
- [Narrator] We're driving
out to Long Island today

00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:04.995
because we found out
there's a man out there

00:00:04.995 --> 00:00:09.071
who legally changed his
name to Santa Claus,

00:00:09.071 --> 00:00:09.904
so, yeah.

00:00:11.438 --> 00:00:13.857
We're gonna go interview Santa.

00:00:13.857 --> 00:00:16.524
(playful music)

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:21.909
It turns out this Santa's
not so traditional.

00:00:21.909 --> 00:00:24.992
- I drive a black Dodge pickup truck.

00:00:25.843 --> 00:00:27.317
- [Narrator] With vanity plates.

00:00:27.317 --> 00:00:28.794
- Oh, yes, I have vanity plates

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.377
that says SANTASLA.

00:00:31.899 --> 00:00:34.666
- [Narrator] Before he
was Santa, he was Frank.

00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:36.149
- I was born in Brooklyn,

00:00:36.149 --> 00:00:39.527
but we lived here on Long Island.

00:00:39.527 --> 00:00:41.939
I have been married 23 years now.

00:00:41.939 --> 00:00:43.485
- [Narrator] So, how do you tell your wife

00:00:43.485 --> 00:00:46.261
that you're changing
your name to Santa Claus?

00:00:46.261 --> 00:00:48.901
- She said, "As long as I
don't have to change my name,

00:00:48.901 --> 00:00:50.318
"go right ahead."

00:00:51.659 --> 00:00:55.337
- [Narrator] Santa has been
Santa for almost two decades,

00:00:55.337 --> 00:00:56.970
and he's good at it.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.808
- I'm probably on,

00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:01.155
and this is not an exaggeration,

00:01:01.155 --> 00:01:03.930
thousands of refrigerators.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.538
- [Narrator] He's got the laugh.

00:01:05.538 --> 00:01:08.430
(Santa ho ho hos)

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:10.465
- You know, that's my Santa laugh.

00:01:10.465 --> 00:01:12.252
- [Narrator] The suit.

00:01:12.252 --> 00:01:13.824
- I designed my suit.

00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:16.486
- [Narrator] But here are
some other things about Santa

00:01:16.486 --> 00:01:18.096
that might surprise you.

00:01:18.096 --> 00:01:21.096
- I have three tattoos on me, of me.

00:01:22.126 --> 00:01:24.016
I'm very into zombies.

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:24.849
I love

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:26.823
barbecue.

00:01:26.823 --> 00:01:30.893
I have a smoker that you can
fit 150 pounds of meat in.

00:01:30.893 --> 00:01:32.318
- [Narrator] He's got this tiki hut

00:01:32.318 --> 00:01:35.673
and above ground saltwater
pool in his backyard.

00:01:35.673 --> 00:01:38.418
- Yes, I'm that extreme when it comes to

00:01:38.418 --> 00:01:40.251
my idea of relaxation.

00:01:41.679 --> 00:01:44.255
- [Narrator] So there's a
little Frank left in there,

00:01:44.255 --> 00:01:48.235
but no question, he's fully
committed to being Santa.

00:01:48.235 --> 00:01:51.172
- I wanna look like the poem says.

00:01:51.172 --> 00:01:54.505
I'm the most loved person on the planet.

00:01:56.651 --> 00:01:59.497
- [Narrator] We totally met Santa.

00:01:59.497 --> 00:02:02.164
(playful music)

